## Verification

```yaml
verify_delegation:
  cmd:   "python3 audit/scripts/gguf_verify.py --stub-check"
  pass:  "verdict == DELEGATES_OK"
  fail:  "verdict == HARDCODED_STUB  or  verdict == INLINE_PARSE_OK"

verify_real_output:
  cmd:   "hace brain model verify qwen.gguf"
  pass:  "tensor_count matches python3 audit/scripts/gguf_verify.py qwen.gguf output"
  fail:  "output shows tensor_count: 291 regardless of model"
```
